* File: !MAKEFILE   For CRC Utilities
*
* Define location of GenAsm, GenLink, GenWipe via macro e.g. $(GA)
*   Remove the explicit BIN folder to allow OS to search path or specify your
*   own location such as pfmdisk or ramdisk. Always use included $MAKE file
*   as it corrects a few bugs and supports TIPI
*
* 09.06.2026 Changed LINK to LINKW. Disabled separate WIPE.

GA=BIN\ASM
GL=BIN\LINKW
* GW=BIN\WIPE  ;combined into LINKer

*
* ALERT -->ALWAYS validate SOURCE FILES & MAKEFILE before release<--
*
* General Usage:
* -------------
* MAKE CRC               Make CRCOS7
* MAKE CRCINS            Make CRC Installer
*
* MAKE ALL               Make all programs in this file
*
* Special Flag examples:
*   MAKE ALL,F           FORCE build of all object/program files
*   MAKE CRC,V           VIEW the list of actions for a make attempt
*
***************************************************************************
* 3.24.2024 Removed CRC/CRCINS/WIPE from MDOS make file
*
*
ALL:   CRC CRCINS

* Explicitly MAKE this; not part of ALL,
CRCINS: CRCINSO
CRCINSO: CRCINSS CRCMAINS
       $(GA) CRCINSS,CRCINSO,,RCO
*      $(GW)
       $(GL) CRCINSL
*
CRC: CRCOS7O
CRCOS7O: CRCOS7S CRCMAINS
       $(GA) CRCOS7S,CRCOS7O,,RCO
*      $(GW)
       $(GL) CRCOS7L

* EOF
